{"id":22008,"name":"向着地平线的终点","rarity":4,"path":"Rogue","desc":"巡猎命途专属的光锥，光锥技能仅对该命途生效。","story":"<i>「开拓者车队领先！终点近在咫尺，开拓者车队能拿下最后的胜利吗？」</i>\\n万众瞩目的赛道上，引擎的轰鸣和人群的欢呼尽数交织。\\n\\n<i>「保持速度一路向前，球棒浣熊，你一定可以！」</i>\\n一个心声鼓励着自己，坚定而有力。\\n\\n突破冲线前的瞬间，心跳、风、呐喊、加速冲刺的声响合拍同频，趋于寂静。\\n而竞逐者的眼中仅剩一条广阔赛道通向天际。\\n\\n恍然，掌声雷动，礼炮齐响。\\n<i>「我…赢了！开拓者车队，赢了！」</i>\\n落日余晖洒向地平线尽头，一场属于胜利的狂欢已然来临。","max_promotion":6,"max_rank":5,"skill":{"id":22008,"name":"超越","desc":"使装备者的攻击力提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#1[i]%</unbreak></color>。装备者施放追加攻击后，使装备者的暴击伤害提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#2[f1]%</unbreak></color>，持续<unbreak>#3[i]</unbreak>回合，该效果最多叠加<unbreak>#4[i]</unbreak>层。","level":{"1":{"level":1,"param_list":[0.12,0.03,2,10]},"2":{"level":2,"param_list":[0.15,0.035,2,10]},"3":{"level":3,"param_list":[0.18,0.04,2,10]},"4":{"level":4,"param_list":[0.21,0.044999998,2,10]},"5":{"level":5,"param_list":[0.24,0.05,2,10]}}},"stats":{"0":{"hp_base":38.4,"hp_add":5.76,"attack_base":21.6,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":18,"defence_add":2.7,"max_level":20,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":4000},{"ItemID":116001,"ItemNum":5}]},"1":{"hp_base":84.48,"hp_add":5.76,"attack_base":47.52,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":39.6,"defence_add":2.7,"max_level":30,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":8000},{"ItemID":110191,"ItemNum":3},{"ItemID":116001,"ItemNum":10}]},"2":{"hp_base":145.92,"hp_add":5.76,"attack_base":82.08,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":68.4,"defence_add":2.7,"max_level":40,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":16000},{"ItemID":110192,"ItemNum":3},{"ItemID":116002,"ItemNum":6}]},"3":{"hp_base":207.36,"hp_add":5.76,"attack_base":116.64,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":97.2,"defence_add":2.7,"max_level":50,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":40000},{"ItemID":110192,"ItemNum":6},{"ItemID":116002,"ItemNum":9}]},"4":{"hp_base":268.8,"hp_add":5.76,"attack_base":151.2,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":126,"defence_add":2.7,"max_level":60,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":80000},{"ItemID":110193,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":116003,"ItemNum":5}]},"5":{"hp_base":330.24,"